# Agent workflow (Civs)

Before non-trivial work, read `docs/AGENT-WORKFLOW.md`.

- Open a GitHub issue with one of: `tipo:correção`, `tipo:melhoria`, `tipo:nova-função`.
- Ship via PR that mentions the issue (`Closes #N` / `Refs #N`).
- Observability primary = OpenTelemetry; Sentry + one of Datadog/New Relic as backends.
- Node runner quality: Biome, commitlint, knip, arch-contract, Stryker; coverage via Codecov; browser E2E via Playwright when UI exists.
- Any web/operator UI: design-motion-principles skill — skeleton, lazy load, enter/exit, loading, progress, `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Prefer Hermes forge scripts for cheap drafts; parent reviews before apply/commit.
